<p>Use this dialog box to make settings for the <span class="Term-Soft">Unauthorized 
 Copy Prevention for Pattern</span> function.</p>
<p>To open this dialog box, select <span class="Term-Soft">Unauthorized Copy 
 Prevention for Pattern</span> in <span class="Term-Soft">Unauthorized Copy 
 Prevention Type</span> on the <span class="Term-Soft">Effects</span> menu, 
 and then click <span class="Term-Soft">Details...</span>.</p>
<p>Available functions differ depending on the printer or printer driver 
 you are using.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>Depending on the unauthorized copy prevention 
 settings, the driver's prevention pattern may be overwritten by the printer's 
 pattern.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="image" role="heading">Prevention Copy Pattern Print Image</p>
<p>Displays an image of the prevention copy pattern print.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>The images for <span class="Term-Soft">Mask Type:</span> 
 may not be displayed.</p></li>
<li><p>The images for <span class="Term-Soft">Layout:</span>, 
 <span class="Term-Soft">2 sided:</span>, <span class="Term-Soft">Booklet:</span>, 
 and <span class="Term-Soft">Poster:</span> may not be displayed.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="stringtype" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Text Type:</span></p>
<p>Select the text type for the <span class="Term-Soft">Prevention Text</span> 
 in the list.</p>
<p aria-level="4" class="T3" id="entertext" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Enter User Text:</span></p>
<p class="Normal-indent">If you select <span class="Term-Soft">User Text</span> 
 in <span class="Term-Soft">Text Type:</span>, enter a user text using up 
 to 64 single-byte characters.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="font" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Font:</span></p>
<p>Select the font type for the prevention text. Only TrueType fonts are 
 available.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="fontstyle" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Font Style:</span></p>
<p>Select the font style.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="size" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Size:</span></p>
<p>Specify a value to adjust the size of the prevention text.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>If you use a small font, it may not be effective 
 for the prevention copy pattern.</p></li>
<li><p>A font size of over 50 points is effective, and 
 70 to 80 points is recommended.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="angle" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Angle:</span></p>
<p>Specify a value in this spin box to rotate the prevention text about 
 its central point.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>An Angle of 30 to 40 degrees is effective for 
 the prevention copy pattern and is recommended.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="position" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Position:</span></p>
<p>Select a position to enter the prevention text in the list.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="repeat" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Repeat:</span></p>
<p>Print the prevention text string repeatedly from the top left of the 
 page. <span class="Term-Soft">Position:</span> is not available.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="carriage" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Line Space:</span></p>
<p>Specify the line spacing.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="outline" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Outlined</span></p>
<p>Prints the text in outline form.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>You cannot select the <span class="Term-Soft">Text 
 Only</span> check box when the <span class="Term-Soft">Outlined</span> check 
 box is selected.</p></li>
<li><p>When you select the <span class="Term-Soft">Outlined</span> 
 check box, the <span class="Term-Soft">Reverse Patterns: Text/Background</span> 
 check box is automatically selected at the same time.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="textonly" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Text Only</span></p>
<p>Use only the text pattern when printing with the unauthorized copy prevention. 
 This is useful when the background pattern would make the document hard 
 to read.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>You cannot select the <span class="Term-Soft">Outlined</span> 
 check box when the <span class="Term-Soft">Text Only</span> check box is 
 selected.</p></li>
<li><p>You cannot select the check box when the <span class="Term-Soft">Reverse Patterns: Text/Background</span> check box is 
 selected.</p></li>
<li><p>You cannot select the <span class="Term-Soft">Mask 
 Type</span> check box when the <span class="Term-Soft">Text Only</span> 
 check box is selected.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="reverse" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Reverse Patterns: Text/Background</span></p>
<p>Exchange the pattern of the text and the pattern of the background.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>You cannot select the <span class="Term-Soft">Text 
 Only</span> check box when the <span class="Term-Soft">Reverse Patterns: 
 Text/Background</span> check box is selected.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="mask" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Mask Type:</span></p>
<p>Select the mask type for the background pattern.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>You cannot select the <span class="Term-Soft">Reverse 
 Patterns: Text/Background</span> check box when a mask type is selected.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><p>You cannot select the <span class="Term-Soft">Text 
 Only</span> check box when a mask type is selected.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="density" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Density:</span></p>
<p>Select the density of the prevention copy text/pattern.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="color" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Color:</span></p>
<p>Select the color that the background text and pattern will print in.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="crop" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">No Pattern Area:</span></p>
<p>Exclude the specified area from being printed with the pattern.<br/>
Use this function for the area such as bar codes.<br/>
Specify the values for <span class="Term-Soft">A:top</span>, <span class="Term-Soft">B:bttm</span>, 
 <span class="Term-Soft">C:left</span>, and <span class="Term-Soft">D:right</span> 
 in mm. The specified range is 1-9999 mm.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="ok" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">OK</span></p>
<p>Saves the changes and closes the dialog box.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="cancel" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Cancel</span></p>
<p>Closes the dialog box without saving any changes.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="default" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Restore Defaults</span></p>
<p>Restores the settings on this dialog box to the default settings.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="help" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Help</span></p>
<p>Displays Help for the dialog box opened.</p>
